  "guid": "dlc.femaleclothes",
  "name": "DLC - Vanilla Fem Clothing",
  "slug": "dlc-vanilla-fem-clothing",
  "teaser": "112 Feminine Proportion Reshaped Vanilla Clothing (Non-Replacing)",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2674.png",
  "downloads": 24667,
  "favourites_count": 15,
  "description": "<p>DLC - Vanilla Fem Clothing</p>\n<p>This mod gives your PMC a more feminine appearance.</p>\n<p>Almost all vanilla clothing has been reshaped to fit a more feminine body type.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, female heads are not included—yet!</p>\n<p><strong>WUVGAWORE :</strong> Just to clarify a few things, this is a project that I made and gave upon after losing interest in SPT; Hjal luckily chose to update and publish it instead of letting it sit in dust but, it was only 50% done when I stopped making SPT mods. Here’s what’s included and what’s missing.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>112 (Non-Replacing) Reshaped USEC, BEAR, SCAV clothing found under Ragman&gt;Services</li>\n<li>1 Universally used placeholder first person view gloves, this means that every top included in the mod does not have it’s matching gloves but instead a placeholder one as I never got around to changing them to the default gloves or modeling my own</li>\n<li>0 Boss outfits</li>\n<li>0 New Heads</li>\n<li>Color will be slightly darker as I couldn’t replicate the vanilla materials 1:1</li>\n<li>I wanted realistic proportions that wouldn’t take away from the vanilla game, meaning non-gooner and very subtle</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How-To Install</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Highly Recommended Mods</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1277/wtt-head-and-voice-selector/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Head and Voice Selector</a><br />\n- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1519/wtt-waac-womens-advanced-assault-corps/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - W.A.A.C. (Women’s Advanced Assault Corps</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/62485/wuvgawore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a> &gt; Reshaping<br />\n- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/30890/grooveypenguinx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">GrooveypenguinX</a> &gt; Code Framework<br />\n- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/85926/potat/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Potat</a> &gt; Localization</p></div></div></div>\n",
